###改正后原文
The Chinese government greatly cares about people's healthy diet. With positive advocation of healthy diet, people gain a deeper understanding of the importance of boosting health 
with reasonable nutrition. Safe, nutritious and healthy eating is a basic need for a good life and an essential requirement for improving people’s sense of happiness, and it also 
offers new opportunities for the development of the food industry. At present, governments at all levels are carrying out a variety of measures to guarantee people’s dietary health
and push forward the building of a Healthy China.

###标准版
The Chinese government attaches great importance to people’s healthy diet. By vigorously promoting healthy eating, people have gained a deeper understanding of the significance of 
reasonable nutrition for improving health. “Eating safely, nutritiously and healthily” is people’s fundamental need for a better life and an essential requirement for enhancing 
people’s sense of happiness. It also creates new opportunities for the development of the food industry. Currently, governments at all levels are adopting various measures to ensure
people’s dietary health and advance the building of a Healthy China.
